{"strongs": "H1995", "word": "הָמוֺן", "translit": "ha.mon", "root": "המון", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "sound, murmur, roar, crowd, abundance", "definition": "הָמוֺן noun masculine 1Sam 4:14 ( feminine Job 31:34 ) sound, murmur, roar, crowd, abundance ; — absolute ׳ ה 1Sam 4:14 + 27 t. ( + 2Kgs 25:11 = אָמוֺן in || Jer 52:15 , see II. אָמוֺן above); construct הֲמוֺן Gen 17:14 + 30 t. + Ezek 39:11 ; Ezek 39:15 ( גֵּיא הֲמוֺן גּוֺג ); suffix הֲמוֺנוֺ Isa 5:13 + 2 t. + Ezek 31:18 Qr + 3 t. ( Kt המונה ); so also Co for proper name (?) הֲמוֺנָה (q. v.) Ezek 39:16 הַמוֺנָהּ Isa 5:14 + 6 t. + Ezek 7:12 ; Ezek 7:13 ; Ezek 30:4 (all strike out B Co ; in Ezek 7:13 also Da ), הֲמֹנָהּ Ezek 29:19 הֲמוֺנָם Isa 31:4 ; Ezek 7:11 plural הֲמֹנִים Joel 4:14 (twice in verse); suffix הֲמוֺנֶיהָ Ezek 32:30 — הֲמָנְכֶם Ezek 5:7 see below המן below; — 1. sound, murmur, rush, roar , especially sound made by a crowd of people, murmur, roar Ps 65:8 לְאֻמִּים ׳ ה (|| שְׁאוֺן יַמִּים etc.); compare ׳ קוֺל ה Isa 13:4 sound of a roaring (|| קוֺל שְׁאוֺן ), Isa 33:3 ; Dan 10:6 הֲמוֺן עַמִּים Isa 17:12 (|| שְׁאוֺן לְאֻמִּים ) where again compared with הֲמוֺת יַמִּים ; also Isa 31:4 of throng of shepherds (|| קוֺל ); of a city ׳ ה קִרְיָה Job 39:7 (|| תְּשֻׁאוֺת נֹגֵשׂ ); compare עִיר ׳ ה = noisy city Isa 32:14 , הֲמוֺנָהּ Isa 5:14 of sound of songs שִׁירַיִךְ ׳ ה Ezek 26:13 (|| קוֺל כִנּוֺרַיִךְ ), compare Amos 5:23 (|| זִמְרַת נְבָלֶיךָ ); of crying ׳ קוֺל ה 1Sam 4:14 (|| קוֺל ) צְעָקָה ; see further הֲמוֺן מֵעִים figurative of sympathy Isa 63:15 (|| רַחֲמִים ), compare הָמָה 2 ; of rain הַגֶּשֶׁם ׳ קוֺל ה 1Kgs 18:41 , compare Jer 10:13 = Jer 51:16 — of rumbling of chariot-wheels גַּלְגִּלָּיו ׳ ה Jer 47:3 (|| קוֺל שַׁעֲטַת פַּרְסוֺת & רַעַשׁ לְרִכְבּוֺ ). 2. tumult, confusion (as occasioning a roar) 1Sam 14:19 ; 2Sam 18:29 . 3. crowd, multitude (especially frequently in Ezra, Chronicles): — \\ \\ a. frequently of great army Judg 4:7 ; 1Sam 14:16 ; 1Kgs 20:13 ; 1Kgs 20:28 ; Isa 29:5 (twice in verse); 2Chr 13:8 ; 2Chr 14:10 ; 2Chr 20:2 ; 2Chr 20:12 ; 2Chr 20:15 ; 2Chr 20:24 ; 2Chr 32:7 compare Ezek 39:11 also Ezek 7:12 ; Ezek 7:13 ; Ezek 30:4 (compare emendation above); on Jer 3:23 compare VB ; see further גֵּיא הֲמוֺן גּוֺג Ezek 39:11 ; Ezek 39:15 ; Dan 11:10 ( חֲיָלִים רַבִּים ׳ ה ) v Dan 11:11 v Dan 11:11 v Dan 11:12 v Dan 11:13 (|| חַיִל גָּדוֺל ); also plural Joel Dan 4:14 (twice in verse). \\ \\ b. of a whole people 2Sam 6:19 ; Isa 5:13 ; Isa 16:14 ; Ezek 7:11 ; Ezek 7:14 ; Ezek 29:19 ; Ezek 30:10 ; Ezek 30:15 ; Ezek 31:2 ; Ezek 31:18 ; Ezek 32:12 (twice in verse); Ezek 32:16 ; Ezek 32:18 ; Ezek 32:20 ; Ezek 32:24 ; Ezek 32:25 ; Ezek 32:26 ; Ezek 32:31 ; Ezek 32:32 \\ \\ c. of any great throng 2Kgs 7:13 (twice in verse) (so ᵑ0 2Kgs 25:11 , but || Jer 52:15 הָאָמוֺן ) Ps 42:5 ; Job 31:34 ( רַבָּה ׳ ה ) Ezek 23:42 גּוֺיִם ׳ ה Gen 17:4 ; Gen 17:5 ( P ) compare Isa 29:7 ; Isa 29:8 so, under figure of overwhelming mass of waves Jer 51:42 . 4. great number, abundance (late) נָשִׁים ׳ ה 2Chr 11:23 ** for וַיִּשְׁאַל הֲמַוֺן נָשִׁים Perles Anal. 47 proposes ׳ וִיִּשְׂאוּ לָהֶם נ (compare נשׂא 3 d ); of cattle Jer 49:32 of things: materials for temple-building 1Chr 29:16 tithes & gifts 2Chr 31:10 . Hence 5. abundance, wealth , Ps 37:16 compare Eccl 5:9 (|| כֶּסֶף ), Isa 60:5 ( יָם ׳ ה ; || חֵיל גּוֺיִם ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2190')\">BDB2190</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1995')\">H1995</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H1996')\">H1996</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2189')\">BDB2189</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2191')\">BDB2191</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>הָמוֺן</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"1Sam 4:14\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(9,4,14)\">1Sam 4:14</ref></sup> (<b>feminine</b> <ref ref=\"Job 31:34\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(18,31,34)\">Job 3