are <bdbheb>נשׂא</bdbheb> <b>3 d</b>); of cattle <ref ref=\"Jer 49:32\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(24,49,32)\">Jer 49:32</ref> of things: materials for temple-building <ref ref=\"1Chr 29:16\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(13,29,16)\">1Chr 29:16</ref> tithes &amp; gifts <ref ref=\"2Chr 31:10\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(14,31,10)\">2Chr 31:10</ref>. Hence </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> <highlight>abundance, wealth</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Ps 37:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,37,16)\">Ps 37:16</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Eccl 5:9\" b=\"21\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(21,5,9)\">Eccl 5:9</ref> (|| <bdbheb>כֶּסֶף</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Isa 60:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,60,5)\">Isa 60:5</ref> (<bdbheb>יָם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ה</bdbheb>; || <bdbheb>חֵיל גּוֺיִם</bdbheb>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "1Sam 4:14", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 4, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Job 31:34", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 31, "verse": 34}, {"raw": "2Kgs 25:11", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 25, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Jer 52:15", "book": "JER", "chapter": 52, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Gen 17:14", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 17, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Ezek 39:11", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 39, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Ezek 39:15", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 39, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Isa 5:13", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 5, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Ezek 31:18", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 31, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Ezek 39:16", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 39, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Isa 5:14", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 5, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Ezek 7:12", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 7, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Ezek 7:13", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 7, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Ezek 30:4", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 30, "